
0 Limbo - Absolutely no edits to this zone, EVER.
1 Mother Risen's - Same policy applies to this zone.
2 Special zone - Zone two is comprised of VNUMS 200 to 899. No edits here unless
approved by a level 59+ IMM. This zone is comprised of objects the src folder
needs. It also contains a number of quest items.
10 IMM Test Zone - I've created this zone for temporary testing purposes.
12 God Rooms - This is where we live, get approval from a level 59+ IMM before
editing anything in this zone.
14 In the Air - Not a zone that was originally intended to be special to this MUD,
but some sloppy editing stuck this in the mess of necessity zones.
30 Northern Midgaard - This is the loading zone for new characters. Do not Edit
this zone on the main port unless you get approval from a 59+ IMM.
76 Official holiday Zone - If you're going to make a quest, item, or mob for a
holiday, it should go here.
105 RavenWide MobChute - this area is the "area wide" mob chute. I'm sure you all
know what the Guardian is, loads here.
167 Land of Reborn - This area contains all the race hall guilds that were
developed with the introduction of remort.
180 Samsera - This zone comprises VNUMS 18000 18199. This is where level 15+
players will load.
193 198 378 Clan Zones - These three zones make up the clan halls on RavenMUD.
380 - 390 Guild Halls - These zones contain all the new guild halls that were
created for specific classes.
399 Houses - Never took off, but still resides in the zone files.
411 412 Samsera Vaults - These areas contain all the lockers. At one time this
auto populated until we ran out of room. You'll notice zone 412 is actually the
sewers. However, they used the objects from this zone to populate more lockers.
560 End Zones - End of the zone files, never create a new zone past this number.

You'll see a number of zones that say reserved or change name for build port. If
you setup a zone on the build port for someone, make SURE you change the zone file
name.
